1.2.4 Machine Translation: Distance between Two Words

Suggested Practice:

Translate to a language where the pronouns are gendered (like Spanish, French, etc.). Try to start with a noun that has
a feminine gender.  Insert some text in-between a word and its pronoun.

See if the kind of text that you put in the middle also affects how quickly the pronoun  loses its connection with
the noun that it was referring to.

